      "title": "BIBB/IAB Qualification and Course of Employment Survey 1985/1986",
      "url_or_doi": "https://doi.org/10.4232/1.12563",
      "justification": "A representative sample of the West German labor force conducted between October 1985 and March 1986 by the Federal Institute for Vocational Education and Training (BIBB) and the Institute for Employment Research (IAB). It contains state-level geographic indicators (including Hesse) and detailed variables covering working conditions, physical loads/occupational health risks, and vocational education/training histories."
